<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">MedCLM: Learning to Localize and Reason via a CoT-Curriculum in Medical Vision-Language Models
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Soo Yong Kim
